manity was on the verge of destruction at the hands of the evil scientist Dr. Hell and his underground empire. Kouji Kabuto, his Mazinger Z super robot, and his friends at the photon power laboratory put an end to Dr. Hell's evil ambitions, and returned peace to the world.\n\nIt has been 10 years since then. Kouji has followed his father and grandfather and now walks the path of a scientist. He encounters a mysterious life form buried in a giant structure buried deep below Mt. Fuji. A new encounter, a new threat, and a new fate await humanity. And Kouji, who was once a hero, makes a decision for the future.\n\nIt can be a god or a demon.\n\nOnce again the future is entrusted to Mazinger Z.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Super Robot","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mythology","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Mazinger Z: INFINITY","english":null,"native":"劇場版 マジンガーZ ／ INFINITY","romaji":"Mazinger Z: INFINITY","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"剧场版 魔神Z / INFINITY"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"魔神Z 无限"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"鐵甲萬能俠：決戰魔神（港）"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"劇場版 無敵鐵金剛 / INFINITY（台）"}]},"trailer":{"id":"PKACASWJjXs","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PKACASWJjXs/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}